<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
{{> head title="Terms of service"}}
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
{{> navbar}}
<main id="main">
  <div class="container section" style="max-width:760px;">
    <h1>Terms of service</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated {{currentYear}}</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;">What CareStem is</h2>
    <p>CareStem is an appointment-booking platform that connects patients with independent doctors. We are not a medical provider, do not offer medical advice, and are not a certified healthcare institution.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;">Emergencies</h2>
    <p>CareStem is not for emergencies. If you have a medical emergency, call your local emergency number or go to the nearest emergency room immediately.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;">Doctor verification</h2>
    <p>Doctors on this platform submit an application that is manually reviewed before their profile becomes visible. CareStem does not independently verify medical licenses beyond the information doctors provide, and users should exercise their own judgment.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;">Appointments</h2>
    <p>Booking an appointment reserves a token/slot with the selected doctor. Doctors and patients may cancel appointments; no payment is processed on this platform.</p>
  </div>
</main>
{{> footer}}
<script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
